    "authoredAtWriteUp": "true = the ⚠ flag of §18.1 / §34.4 — written during the spec write-up with no ticket behind it and no paper evidence at all. Six technologies carry it: Knights ×2, Lifewarden ×2, Troll ×2."
  },

